local-changes:
  - renamed (DR-02, 2026-10-22): kit-core is core-kernel (@core/kernel), kit-web-core is core-web (@core/web), not core-core
    and core-web-core
  - all packages: dependency versions pinned to the DOC-11 versions (exact, no `^`; `@types/bun` and the others that were `latest`)
  - all packages: `exports` point at `src/*.ts` for the `bun`, `types` and `default` conditions (nothing is built or published, and
    Metro has no `bun` condition); `build` script, `files` and `tsconfig.build.json` removed; `test` script is
    `bun test --pass-with-no-tests` where the reference had none; version 0.0.0
  - core-runtime: `AppModule.privacy` and the `@core/privacy-participant` dependency removed (DR-03, DR-98)
  - core-db: `Database.transaction()` added: begins a transaction, and inside an open one it is a savepoint; `run()` calls it
    when no transaction is open and still joins an open one (DOC-12 §8.1 items 1 and 2); test in `src/database.test.ts`
  - OpenTelemetry pinned to the 2.12 line (`@opentelemetry/api` 1.9.1, `resources` and `sdk-trace-node` 2.12.0,
    `exporter-trace-otlp-http` 0.223.0): `sdk-trace-node` 2.12.0 accepts `api` below 1.10 only (DOC-11 §3, §10)
  - core-core: the error classes of DOC-42 §4.1 (`ValidationError` with `details`, `RuleViolationError`, `PreconditionRequiredError`,
    `PayloadTooLargeError`, `UpgradeRequiredError`, `LockedError`, `RateLimitedError`, `UnavailableError`, `BadGatewayError`,
    `InvariantError`; `DomainError` carries `details` and `retryAfterSeconds`; `TooManyRequestsError` is `RateLimitedError`) (P1-04)
  - core-telemetry: `createLogger(level, { service, destination })`: ISO `time`, `level` as a word, `service`, redaction list,
    `err` serializer that keeps the SQLSTATE and drops the PostgreSQL `detail` (DOC-42 §8.3) (P1-04)
  - core-context: `RequestContext` carries `accountKind`, `accountId`, `role`, `buildingId`, `unitId` (P1-04)
  - core-http: `API_PREFIX` is `/api/v1`; the request id is a UUIDv7 and `[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}` (DOC-50 §5.1); the error handler is the
    answer of DOC-42 §3 (no `requestId` in the body, SQLSTATE mapping, `constraintErrors`, rule codes of DOC-42 §5.2); new
    `requestLogPlugin` (DOC-42 §8.1), `createClientIp`/`bucketIp` (DOC-39 §5.3), `corsPlugin` (replaces `@elysiajs/cors`, AG-25),
    `routePlugin` (`normalize: false`, AG-20) and `strictObject`; `maintenancePlugin` answers the shape of DOC-42 (P1-04)
  - core-runtime: `healthRoutes` is replaced by `readyRoute` and `liveRoute` (DOC-51 E-01, E-02: `ok`/`degraded`/`stopping`, checks with
    latency, the public path lists no dependency) (P1-04)
  - core-messaging: `OutboxRelay` takes `policy(type) -> { maxAttempts }`, `backoffBaseSeconds`, `backoffMaxSeconds`, `cleanupIntervalMs`
    and the sources carry their inbox (DR-118); the backoff, the dead-letter limit and the deferral budget are computed by the database
    clock in one UPDATE (DOC-38 §2.3); cleanup also deletes delivered inbox rows; `isFresh(maxAgeMs)`, `lastPassAt` and `sourceNames`;
    handler lines carry the message's correlation id as their request id; `DrizzleOutboxWriter` takes `OutboxRules` (the catalog
    of the module, the source, `buildingId`, the payload limit: JB-23, MC-05); new `OutboxAdmin` (list, requeue, discard dead
    letters); the zod `outboxConfig` slice is removed (the application builds `OutboxSettings` from DOC-41) (P1-05)
  - core-db: `Database.transaction(fn, { isolationLevel, accessMode })` for the `snapshot` jobs (P1-05)
  - core-runtime: `AppModule.jobs` is `JobDefinition[]` (not `ModuleJobs`); new `JobRuntime` (interval timers, the clock-job scheduler,
    `job_run` rows, `ctx.withLock`/`ctx.snapshot`, pause, stop with a timeout, `runNow`), `schedule.ts` (`lastSlot`, `decide`),
    `SqlJobRunStore`; `createRuntime` takes the relay settings, the manifests (for `outboxPolicies`) and the job settings and
    returns `relayCheck`, `startWorker`, `stopWorker`; `intervalJobs`/`noJobs` are removed (P1-05)
  - core-runtime: `db-cli.ts` (the reference's db:generate/db:migrate), `cluster.ts` (process supervisor) and `maintenance-config.ts` (a zod slice)
    are removed: `scripts/migrate.ts` and `scripts/db.ts` run the migrations of this project (DOC-19 §3.1), the scaling unit is the
    container (DOC-41 `APP_PROCESSES`) and the key is in `apps/api/src/bootstrap/config` (P1-06)
